# Magic Board — environment variables.
#
# There are none. This is a pure client-side app: the model endpoint, model id
# and API key are entered in the in-app Settings dialog at runtime and kept in
# the browser's local storage.
#
# Nothing is read from VITE_* on purpose. Anything Vite inlines at build time
# would be visible to anyone who loads the page, so credentials deliberately
# cannot be baked into a deployment.

# Copy to .env only if you add genuinely non-secret, build-time config later.
